{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pLXEZrcWiA1794307341.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名女工去年在元朗被清拆中的的村屋圍牆壓死，三間承建商罰款13萬元至15.5萬元。</p><p></p><p>事發在去年11月5日，元朗山貝路一幢村屋進行拆卸，女死者負責在圍牆外清理，圍牆突然倒塌將她壓住，送院後不治。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.WORKER-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HD4riXITy11794307349.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>勞工處檢控涉案的展鋒工程、鈞威機械工程及另一承建商，違反《工廠及工業經營條例》，今日在粉嶺裁判法院分別判罰13萬元及15.5萬元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.018859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T18:59:09.603038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:00.574829+00:00","content_hash":"6f1f0a7c013a42a002933d4dfb8ced48a000c4f05112b042b521a114a646fc28","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}